WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.480
Think about this. What is established about Case A's currently payable

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:06.700
balance? Let's work through it together.

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.860
I'm Dr. Gainz. Lesson 22.

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:13.320
Review a fictional case from start to handoff.

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:15.960
Case A is entirely fictional.

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.460
An owner initiates contact and authorizes document organization.

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:24.240
A sale result records $225 ,000.

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:30.260
Supplied accounting records show $18 ,000 in costs and a $172

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:35.440
,000 obligation. An older worksheet suggests a $35 ,000

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:40.140
residual. A later document describes a possible $13 ,000 competing

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:44.860
interest, but the supplied material does not establish its disposition or a

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:49.780
current payable balance. Your job is to organize what is known, not decide

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:53.540
that the owner is owed $35 ,000 or $22 ,000.

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:57.400
Prepare the process classification, authorization, authority scope,

00:00:57.820 --> 00:01:02.160
document index, event log, illustrative scenarios, and unresolved

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:06.320
questions. Request current custodian information through the appropriate

00:01:06.320 --> 00:01:10.020
process and refer the competing interest issue for proper review.

00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:14.120
A complete practice submission identifies missing facts openly.

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:17.740
Do not reward yourself for a larger estimated recovery.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:22.000
Evaluate whether another reviewer could trace the sources and understand

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:24.800
exactly which decisions remain unresolved.

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:26.920
Pause and try this.

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:29.060
Complete the capstone worksheet.

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:33.560
Produce a one -page handoff brief and a neutral owner update using

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:35.260
fictional Case A only.

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:40.640
Quick knowledge check. What is established about Case A's currently payable

00:01:40.640 --> 00:01:44.260
balance? The answer? It remains unverified.

00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:49.080
Illustrative scenarios and a possible competing interest do not establish a

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:53.560
current payable balance. Keep the source, the date, and the unknowns

00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:55.920
visible. I'll see you in the next lesson.
